ers come  back and play for hunting hundreds of  millions of hours but uh we know that  they want more and that's what i really  feel great about what you know so much  diablo is coming now is that we're  actually able to sort of help satiate  some of the fan desires and what they're  really gonna get a deal before is not  only a great launch but a very rich post  launch all right joe thanks for hanging  out talking about d4 in the franchise um  that's it from us so i hope you stay  tuned we have lots of stuff to talk  about coming up especially you know more  d4  [Music]  you

